<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαγρι-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make wild</i> or <i>waste,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώραν,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξημερόω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.69
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made so,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.98
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= foreg., <i>make savage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				876
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be brutalized,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ πόθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					870a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.584
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>become</i> or <i>be savage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				17.6.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι, κατά τινος,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				19.1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.6.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
